To build :
    - get JXA API SRC PACK and compile it for your platform !
    - Once done, copy and paste
        JIGAXtended-YOUR OS-YOUR ARCH-ext_signed.jar,
        JIGAXtended-YOUR OS-YOUR ARCH-ext-kernel_signed.jar,
        JIGAXtended-YOUR OS-YOUR ARCH-ext-native_signed.jar
        and JIGAXtended-YOUR OS-YOUR ARCH-ext-props_signed.jar
into the resources/YOUR OS/YOUR ARCH folder !
    - Compile and Run this project !